      "source": [
        "### Explanation of Columns in the German Credit Dataset\n",
        "\n",
        "Here is a detailed explanation of what each variable in the dataset represents:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **`status_existing_checking_account`**: Status of existing checking account (e.g., `< 0 DM`, `0 <= ... < 200 DM`, no checking account).\n",
        "2. **`duration_months`**: Duration of the credit in months.\n",
        "3. **`credit_history`**: Credit history (e.g., no credits taken, all credits paid back duly, delay in paying off in the past, critical account).\n",
        "4. **`purpose`**: Purpose of the credit (e.g., car, furniture/equipment, radio/television, domestic appliances, repairs, education, business).\n",
        "5. **`credit_amount`**: Credit amount in Deutsche Mark (DM).\n",
        "6. **`savings_account_bonds`**: Savings account/bonds status (e.g., `< 100 DM`, `100 <= ... < 500 DM`, `unknown/ no savings account`).\n",
        "7. **`present_employment_since`**: Present employment status since (e.g., unemployed, `< 1 year`, `1 <= ... < 4 years`, `>= 7 years`).\n",
        "8. **`installment_rate_disposable_income`**: Installment rate in percentage of disposable income.\n",
        "9. **`personal_status_sex`**: Personal status and sex (e.g., male: divorced/separated, female: divorced/separated/married, male: single, male: married/widowed).\n",
        "10. **`other_debtors_guarantors`**: Other debtors or guarantors (e.g., none, co-applicant, guarantor).\n",
        "11. **`present_residence_since`**: Duration of residency in current dwelling (years).\n",
        "12. **`property`**: Most valuable available property (e.g., real estate, building society savings agreement/life insurance, car).\n",
        "13. **`age_years`**: Age of the debtor in years.\n",
        "14. **`other_installment_plans`**: Other installment plans (e.g., bank, stores, none).\n",
        "15. **`housing`**: Housing type (e.g., rent, own, for free).\n",
        "16. **`number_credits_this_bank`**: Number of existing credits at this bank.\n",
        "17. **`job`**: Employment/Job status (e.g., unemployed/ unskilled - non-resident, unskilled - resident, skilled employee / official, management/ self-employed/ highly qualified employee).\n",
        "18. **`number_people_liable_maintenance`**: Number of people being liable to provide maintenance for.\n",
        "19. **`telephone`**: Whether a telephone is registered under the customer's name (yes/no).\n",
        "20. **`foreign_worker`**: Whether the customer is a foreign worker (yes/no).\n",
        "21. **`credit_risk`**: Credit risk rating (1 = Good, 2 = Bad)."
      ]
    },
